  "description": "NaAgO crystallizes in the tetragonal I̅4m2 space group. Na is bonded in a see-saw-like geometry to four equivalent O atoms. There are a spread of Na-O bond distances ranging from 2.36-2.40 Å. Ag is bonded in a linear geometry to two equivalent O atoms. Both Ag-O bond lengths are 2.10 Å. O is bonded to four equivalent Na and two equivalent Ag atoms to form a mixture of corner and edge-sharing ONa₄Ag₂ octahedra. The corner-sharing octahedral tilt angles range from 1-15°.",
